{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":30,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 30:1"},"The words of Agur the son of Jakeh, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," the prophecy: the man spake unto Ithiel, even unto Ithiel and Ucal, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 30:2"},"Surely I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["am"]}," more brutish than ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["any"]}," man, and have not the understanding of a man. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 30:3"},"I neither learned wisdom, nor have the knowledge of the holy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 30:4"},"Who hath ascended up into heaven, or descended? who hath gathered the wind in his fists? who hath bound the waters in a garment? who hath established all the ends of the earth? what ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his name, and what ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his son’s name, if thou canst tell? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 30:5"},"Every word of God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," pure: he ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a shield unto them that put their trust in him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 30:6"},"Add thou not unto his words, lest he reprove thee, and thou be found a liar. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 30:7"},"Two ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," have I required of thee; deny me ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them "]},"not before I die: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 30:8"},"Remove far from me vanity and lies: give me neither poverty nor riches; feed me with food convenient for me: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 30:9"},"Lest I be full, and deny ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thee,"]}," and say, Who ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the LORD? or lest I be poor, and steal, and take the name of my God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in vain. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 30:10"},"Accuse not a servant unto his master, lest he curse thee, and thou be found guilty. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 30:11"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," a generation ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," curseth their father, and doth not bless their mother. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 30:12"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," a generation ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that are"]}," pure in their own eyes, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["yet"]}," is not washed from their filthiness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 30:13"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," a generation, O how lofty are their eyes! and their eyelids are lifted up. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 30:14"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," a generation, whose teeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are as"]}," swords, and their jaw teeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," knives, to devour the poor from off the earth, and the needy from ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["among"]}," men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 30:15"},"The horseleach hath two daughters, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["crying,"]}," Give, give. There are three ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things that are"]}," never satisfied, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["yea,"]}," four ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," say not, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," enough: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 30:16"},"The grave; and the barren womb; the earth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," is not filled with water; and the fire ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," saith not, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," enough. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 30:17"},"The eye ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," mocketh at ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," father, and despiseth to obey ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," mother, the ravens of the valley shall pick it out, and the young eagles shall eat it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 30:18"},"There be three ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things which"]}," are too wonderful for me, yea, four which I know not: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 30:19"},"The way of an eagle in the air; the way of a serpent upon a rock; the way of a ship in the midst of the sea; and the way of a man with a maid. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 30:20"},"Such ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the way of an adulterous woman; she eateth, and wipeth her mouth, and saith, I have done no wickedness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 30:21"},"For three ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," the earth is disquieted, and for four ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," it cannot bear: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 30:22"},"For a servant when he reigneth; and a fool when he is filled with meat; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 30:23"},"For an odious ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["woman"]}," when she is married; and an handmaid that is heir to her mistress. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 30:24"},"There be four ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things which are"]}," little upon the earth, but they ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," exceeding wise: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 30:25"},"The ants ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," a people not strong, yet they prepare their meat in the summer; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 30:26"},"The conies ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are but"]}," a feeble folk, yet make they their houses in the rocks; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 30:27"},"The locusts have no king, yet go they forth all of them by bands; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 30:28"},"The spider taketh hold with her hands, and is in kings’ palaces. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 30:29"},"There be three ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," which go well, yea, four are comely in going: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 30:30"},"A lion ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which is"]}," strongest among beasts, and turneth not away for any; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 30:31"},"A greyhound; an he goat also; and a king, against whom ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is "]},"no rising up. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PRO 30:32"},"If thou hast done foolishly in lifting up thyself, or if thou hast thought evil, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["lay"]}," thine hand upon thy mouth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:32"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PRO 30:33"},"Surely the churning of milk bringeth forth butter, and the wringing of the nose bringeth forth blood: so the forcing of wrath bringeth forth strife. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 30:33"}]}]}
